# Copy this file to keystore.properties (same folder) and fill in your values.
# keystore.properties is NOT committed; in CI these come from GitHub Secrets.
# The upload keystore for this app lives in ../../keystore/chessfruitfly-upload.keystore
# (created for you; back it up, losing it complicates future updates).
